WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.176 line:82%
Chapter 2. Connect the students' phones.

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:10.955 line:82%
Students answer on their phones, in the web browser. There is no app to install, and no account.

00:00:11.418 --> 00:00:16.996 line:82%
The laptop and the phones must be on the same Wi-Fi. You do not need the internet.

00:00:17.457 --> 00:00:20.576 line:82%
In the menu, open "Connect phones".

00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:25.178 line:82%
Students scan this QR code with the camera of their phone.

00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:28.556 line:82%
Or they type this address in the browser.

00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:34.896 line:82%
Make the QR code bigger, or show it full screen, so students at the back can scan it.

00:00:35.359 --> 00:00:38.237 line:82%
Click anywhere to close the full screen.

00:00:38.695 --> 00:00:45.377 line:82%
The phone opens MI WAY. It waits here. When you start a test, it appears on the phone by itself.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:53.116 line:82%
Android students can also install their own app: MI WAY Student. Press "Install the app on a phone".

00:00:53.574 --> 00:01:01.537 line:82%
Students scan this second QR code and tap "Download the app". It comes from your laptop, so they don't need the internet.

00:01:02.005 --> 00:01:14.956 line:82%
The first time, the student taps your name. After that, the app finds your laptop by itself, on any Wi-Fi, and joins with their own name. iPhones keep using the QR code in Safari.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:21.877 line:82%
The first time, test with your own phone. If the page does not open, follow this check list.

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:29.917 line:82%
Many school Wi-Fi networks block phones. Then turn on the laptop's Mobile hotspot, in the Windows settings.

00:01:30.373 --> 00:01:39.316 line:82%
Windows allows only 8 phones on its hotspot. For a full class, use a small Wi-Fi router. It does not need the internet.

00:01:39.777 --> 00:01:49.376 line:82%
Using a hotspot? Type its name and password here once. Students scan this Wi-Fi QR code to join it without typing the password.
